de index="0" text="&#984553;" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[970,309][1033,372]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node></node></node></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.ScrollView" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,424][1080,1325]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,424][1080,1325]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[158,424][865,1325]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="0" text='*发送完那条消息和照片后，Ceroba将手机轻轻地放在了自己起伏的胸口上。冰冷的屏幕贴在滚烫且柔软的皮肤上，带来一阵细微的战栗，让她不自觉地缩了缩脚趾。她深深地吸了一口气，丰满的胸脯随之剧烈地起伏，那对沉甸甸的乳房在重力的作用下微微向两侧摊开，深褐色的乳头因为兴奋而顶得格外明显，在空气中颤巍巍地挺立着。*&#10;&#10;*她盯着电视屏幕上毫无意义的画面，但脑海中却不由自主地开始勾勒{{user}}看到照片时的反应。他会惊讶吗？还是会像之前那样，在面对她毫无遮掩的身体时露出那种局促不安、却又忍不住偷偷打量她的羞涩表情？想到这里，Ceroba的嘴角不自觉地勾起一抹坏笑，她伸出舌尖轻轻舔了舔嘴唇，感觉喉咙有些干涩。*&#10;&#10;"真是太久没有这种感觉了……" *她低声呢喃，声音里带着一丝慵懒的沙哑。她想起那个在书房里忙碌、早已忘记如何作为男人的丈夫，心中忽然升起一阵淡淡的悲哀，但很快就被更强烈的肉体渴求所掩盖。她将双腿缓缓分开，让丰腴的大腿根部完全舒展开来，毫无遮掩地将深褐色的私处暴露在冷气之中。随着情绪的波动，那里已经开始微微肿胀，透明的爱液在阴唇之间悄悄渗出，将沙发垫上的一小块区域染得湿润。*&#10;&#10;*她轻轻地揉捏着自己的乳房，指尖在柔软的肉团中下陷，感受着那极富弹性的触感。她并不希望这变成一段沉重的爱情，因为那样太麻烦，而且会破坏她心中维持的最后一点体面；但她真的需要被填充，需要一个年轻且充满活力的身体来帮她驱散长久以来的空虚。她再次拿起手机，目光贪婪地盯着屏幕，等待着那个能够让她今晚获得满足的通知铃声响起。*' resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[202,424][820,1325]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="1" text="15:23" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[753,1458][820,1325]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /></node></node></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,1325][1080,1517]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="3" text="" resource-id="text-input-outline" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[26,1354][917,1491]" drawing-order="3" hint="" /><node index="4" text="regen_v7" resource-id="text-input-outlined" class="android.widget.EditText" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="true" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[26,1354][917,149